Files:
  ecapa_gioi.py  derived from model.py (SEModule, Bottle2neck, ECAPA_gender).
                 Modified by LTT Studios on 2026-09-23:
                   - the mel filterbank is built ONCE in __init__ instead of
                     being reconstructed on every forward pass (upstream builds
                     a MelSpectrogram module inside logtorchfbank each call);
                     same parameters, same output.
                   - `predict` (which loads a file path and returns a string)
                     replaced by `xac_suat`, which takes a batch of waveforms
                     and returns softmax probabilities per row, because the
                     caller needs a confidence, not a label, and scores many
                     sliding windows of one clip.
                   - `load_audio` removed; the runner does its own decoding and
                     resampling so that every clip goes through one code path.
                 Layer shapes, weight names and the class order
                 (0 = male, 1 = female) are UNCHANGED, so the published
                 checkpoint loads without remapping.
  ban_ghim.py    written by LTT Studios (pinned revision + sha256).

